# DukaanSathi — Standalone Client Mode
# No external Firebase or live API keys are required to build and run the frontend.
# All data (Sales, Digital Khata, Inventory, Auth) operates reliably via client-side storage.

# Optional: Server-side Gemini AI proxy configuration
# To use live Gemini AI instead of mock demo mode, set the proxy server URL:
# VITE_AI_PROXY_URL=http://localhost:3001
# (Note: GEMINI_API_KEY must be set in the server/ proxy environment, NEVER in the frontend)
# GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here
